# Direct (top-level) Python dependencies for the api/ + bot/ + database/ monolith.
#
# This is the SOURCE file. The pinned lockfile `requirements.txt` is GENERATED from
# it via pip-compile — do NOT hand-edit requirements.txt:
#
#     pip-compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt
#
# Only packages the code actually imports (or runtime entrypoints/drivers) belong
# here. Transitive deps (pydantic-core, eth-keyfile, parsimonious, jsonalias, the
# rest of the eth-*/anyio/yarl stack, …) are resolved + pinned by pip-compile so
# they always satisfy their parents. This is what stops Dependabot from bumping a
# transitive past its parent's constraint (see the #459 breakage).

# ---- Web framework / server ----
